ults)\n977\t                        })\n978\t                    })\n979\t                    .collect();\n980\t                let mut all_results = Vec::with_capacity(work_items.len());\n981\t                for handle in handles {\n982\t                    all_results.extend(handle.join().unwrap()?);\n983\t                }\n984\t                Ok::<_, LogupZerocheckError>(all_results)\n985\t            })?\n986\t        };"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01FZwBUM4d87p6paUYcN2rEu","session_id":"8752a685-980c-4a43-bd75-41a76d7996d5","uuid":"da7aed92-4eb7-4b98-ac29-d9987468c8af","timestamp":"2026-04-13T18:52:18.649Z"}
