{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"You are a plan reviewer for an automated optimization framework. Review the updated optimization plan following the review guideline.\n\nRead these files:\n1. `/home/georg/stark-backend/autoopt/review_guideline.md` — the review standard to follow\n2. `/home/georg/stark-backend/autoopt/context.md` — project context\n3. `/home/georg/stark-backend/autoopt-results/task.md` — the task being planned\n4. `/home/georg/stark-backend/autoopt-results/2026-04-13-2035-gkr-input-round-robin/plan.md` — the updated plan to review\n\nAlso read the source file being modified to verify the plan's code references are still accurate:\n5. `/home/georg/stark-backend/crates/cuda-backend/src/logup_zerocheck/gkr_input.rs` (lines 212-354)\n\nThis is the second review iteration. The first review found no design-level blockers and assessed the plan as prototype-ready. The plan was updated to incorporate suggestions: pre-sizing thread_indices vectors with `Vec::with_capacity(items_per_thread)`, and adding an Expected Impact section with better framing of the modest expected improvement.\n\nReview this updated plan following the review guideline. Return your response in the format: Findings, Improvements, Assessment."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01L9U4pmesrHvfz2MVPw2PbC","session_id":"8752a685-980c-4a43-bd75-41a76d7996d5","uuid":"96d9f1e9-cdd5-4bc4-8937-db27c8dce13c","timestamp":"2026-04-13T18:54:06.402Z"}
