e processing), memory safety (non-overlapping `leaves_ptr` writes), stream safety (`cudaStreamPerThread`), and the APC 0 no-regression guarantee (single-thread path untouched). The expected impact section is well-calibrated -- honest about the modest magnitude and clear about why it is still worth doing.\n\nApprove for prototype implementation."}],"totalDurationMs":83610,"totalTokens":28209,"totalToolUseCount":12,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":421,"cache_read_input_tokens":26371,"output_tokens":1416,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":421},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":1,"output_tokens":1416,"cache_read_input_tokens":26371,"cache_creation_input_tokens":421,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":421,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"toolStats":{"readCount":9,"searchCount":3,"bashCount":0,"editFileCount":0,"linesAdded":0,"linesRemoved":0,"otherToolCount":0}}}
